{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "79d2d50d11874d209c82d3387f46f6e4afe541ea3ce373cbbe4b9ba6a184db9f", "ja": "フェスの準備期間、『アーク』を利用する\nことを許可された3人は、贅沢な設備と、\n961式のハードなレッスン計画に驚きつつ\nも961の本気を感じ取り、そのレッスンを\n受けてみることに。", "zh": "在音乐节的准备期间，获准使用“Ark”\n的3人，在惊叹于奢华的设备和\n961式的高强度训练计划的同时，也感受到了961的认真，决定试着接受那套训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f8e177da7b42f3a62dc753e9b52b529d0f193fc0683e8ae6c4704f2fda987e45", "ja": "（961プロの主催するフェスに参加することになり、\n期間中は会場施設が使い放題とのことだ）", "zh": "（要参加由961事务所主办的音乐节了，据说活动期间可以随意使用会场设施）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4380f41b7d16fbf047d0c74f7aa54d338106eb4c73fc25cb6367292310156135", "ja": "（そしてキャスト全員お揃いの衣装も用意されるとの\nことで、今日はそのフィッティングだ）", "zh": "（而且据说还会为全体演员准备统一的服装，\n所以今天要进行试装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "3645acb37558607ce1b0479f1a067fdc5c1c131d0f78497175d2130439ec1d27", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせ！\n衣装はこんな感じだぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等了！\n服装就是这种感觉哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "22c50e57d5b3f7a9156acdf0966db125221c9efa66eab9cb5c7369bc2a612e1a", "ja": "どうどう？\nミキ、似合ってる？", "zh": "怎么样怎么样？\n美希穿起来合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2154f8f22b5fb383bec56fe09cd7986d3f43997fa843696e3d56007cb4dd9a0d", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\n着てみた感想としてはどうだ？", "zh": "嗯，很合适。\n穿上的感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "5112e9d8a7d5d4a9f6034284c392738179de830d458a7c520b0ca3c8fdfd046f", "ja": "美咲嬢ではない方が作った衣装、袖を通すのは\n若干の不安がありましたが……何も問題ないようです。", "zh": "穿上不是美咲小姐制作的服装，虽然多少有些不安……不过看来并没有任何问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f9db5e0e83199df864d8f5a8b457461be314013dd6f9da1b0a39f88bda067392", "ja": "ならよかった。まさか961プロ側で\n衣装まで用意してもらえるとは……。", "zh": "那就好。没想到连服装都能由961这边准备好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1007_staff", "source_sha256": "4d092820d80b697072a5ffe016daaf9549ce40cd868fd1d7e15a0d8f1cb1722c", "ja": "ぜひ本番想定でガシガシ使い込んでください！\n使い潰しても大丈夫です、何着でも用意できますから！", "zh": "请务必按照正式演出时的需求尽管使用！\n就算穿坏了也没关系，准备多少套都可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36f75b7029b442f5826706ad6fa351166b9782303d21afc8cbf58c1629e8b22e", "ja": "ステージ衣装を、ですか？\nうちにはとても真似できないな……予算的な意味で。", "zh": "是指舞台演出服吗？\n我们这边可实在没法照做啊……从预算上来说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "9501bd90afa353a7a641fc8e5ca486f948428e8c90ef86ae6a97806239be2a35", "ja": "レッスンメニューとかも、スマホで見れるんだっけ？\nええと……え？　レッスンってこんなに入るの！？", "zh": "连练习菜单之类的，也能用手机查看吗？\n呃……诶？练习内容居然这么多！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "31d5cf7e30426de56f844ed576c9b76a09827b103575e451ff57021c369b8768", "ja": "これは……。\n想像以上に厳しい密度ですね……。", "zh": "这个……  \n训练强度比想象中还要大呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "90131f03c205758729851da7913f5dff4042e11b3bd21445bdf67f0a3f45cb49", "ja": "こんなにレッスンしたら、\n絶対本番はヘトヘトになるって思うな！", "zh": "这么练下去，\n正式演出时肯定会累得精疲力竭的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c4fec340fa69b4f0df38593b9b846cd61af6acc087170b85d0fd4b919eae0503", "ja": "（確かに、これをこなせるなら、\nトップアイドルには近づけるだろうけど……）", "zh": "（确实，如果能完成这些，应该就能更接近顶尖偶像了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "a012aef052da3bfb083d948bf20c56a47842ad3e0dc3495e8e6f5f5bbc924ad8", "ja": "でも……そっか。\nやっぱり自分、やってみる。", "zh": "不过……这样啊。\n我果然还是想试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4885d649daa3a9a2ba5c7a16833aead08909bcea18e7988a4e3edaccd91c5364", "ja": "いや、響。\n無理はしなくても……。", "zh": "不，响。\n不用勉强自己的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "af2b2fec919361b9c3f8563de95810f46b309147128a85370dc559bfb6bbbc13", "ja": "今日はそんなに動いてないから大丈夫だぞっ。　それに\n961プロのメニューを自分ができるか試したいしね。", "zh": "今天没怎么运动，所以没问题啦。再说，我也想试试看自己能不能完成961事务所的训练菜单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "d4e0dbff025923d2090e42adc75432aa587f1846c4056a2c76964dda7e20b9ee", "ja": "すみませーん！\nトレーナーさーん！", "zh": "不好意思——！\n教练——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "36b265d7a51e9fabf4e8cb68b675505a89fa48fc8277bad88a51b3afeb13b1ad", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。そういえば、衣装合わ\nせに来てるゲストの子たちって、有名な子が多くない？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。说起来，来试装的嘉宾们，是不是有很多都是知名人物？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "9c4c299a28623a185f513473a51e455776df35a64e30dde1827efad69f0173d2", "ja": "ステージに出るアイドル以外にも、\n人気モデルの子とか、SNSでバズった子とか。", "zh": "除了要登上舞台的偶像之外，还有人气模特，以及在社交平台上爆红的女孩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a20bcd72dccfbfc33e5b91006ba5f125b965abef8b282b27185c9557ef866581", "ja": "ああ。黒井社長の言っていた『アーク』に\n関わる子たちなんだろうな。", "zh": "啊。就是那些和黑井社长所说的“方舟”有关的孩子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "995cd98cb472aa67461c557f0e7ddbe7daa5ebcb0802b353a4d3b61de3a54828", "ja": "有望な子に施設を開放して、新時代を切り拓く\n人物を招待している……ということだと思う。", "zh": "我想，这大概是说……向有潜力的孩子开放设施，邀请能开创新时代的人物前来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "bd26b59071f6cb3acd3804d885198a00822345476a5e0eac35ad5650bb457180", "ja": "なんとも大胆ですね。\nこのような施設を、そこまで幅広く開放するとは……。", "zh": "真是大胆呢。竟然会把这样的设施开放给如此广泛的对象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "f3dcbc2be67c55b1d2a763e477d8e6df6a9dc1ea8942ca2b2cf23b6790165c94", "ja": "黒井殿もそれだけ本気、ということなのでしょうか。", "zh": "看来黑井大人也是认真的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "49478f8090ad26aec94dfb8f8b2076bf83412c4f4ef3f689868c7b01e822245f", "ja": "ああ。ミラノで歌唱力が絶賛されたミュージカル歌手に\n名門バレエ団史上最年少のプリマまでいるな……。", "zh": "啊。连在米兰因歌唱实力备受赞誉的音乐剧歌手，\n以及名门芭蕾舞团史上最年轻的首席舞者都有啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e41b9027047384c2e3dd85c9bb7e05423a92a77fc1ca3a361e43c96d73d766ef", "ja": "本当に、『アーク』とやらは\nどこまで声をかけてるんだろう……。", "zh": "真的不知道，那个叫“阿克”的家伙到底邀请了多少人……岔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "1bccdc47556ebaf8b382280b2ce83319f8d12ac67d813b1bb8e5c5ed946e251c", "ja": "むー……ミキが目の前にいるのに、\n他の女の子のことばっかり。", "zh": "唔……明明美希就在你眼前，却光顾着想着别的女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f2afb2dba4e4efce9904a7e6556b6a3bf3ede29e10a69b7469b0ce6c76ab91a", "ja": "ねえハニ……、{$P$}。\nこの中でミキが活躍したら、うれしい？", "zh": "呐，哈尼……，{$P$}。如果美希能在这里大显身手，你会高兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "012de086ef92318a92e83b559dc6201a4c326dc94b60035a899670db61eeb0f5", "ja": "まあ、それは嬉しいというか、\nフェスのためにもそうあってほしいというか……。", "zh": "倒也不是说高不高兴，\n主要是为了音乐节，我也希望能这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "cdb2ba59d706e01aee1b30d6686ec274a7dc66d9423621feba16a657d0b53b7f", "ja": "じゃあ頑張ろうっと♪\nミキ、響と一緒にやってみるから、見てて☆", "zh": "那就努力吧♪\n美希会和响一起试试的，要看着哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "bba0f5a4f35b4e91f6ee6bcccf5b7b78b5b7a79e6627c6e8e9452b7e423a56ed", "ja": "ふふっ、頼もしいことです。\n二人がその気ならば無論、私もともに。", "zh": "呵呵，真是可靠。\n既然你们两个有这个意愿，当然，我也会一同努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "12c009db9bd2b82232dad73dd563fc3905a9b57d7ab7aa1c7a0b2d2b9c5b9578", "ja": "そこまで言うなら……でも、無理はせずにな！\nなにかあったら必ず声をかけるように！", "zh": "既然你都这么说了……不过，可别勉强自己啊！\n要是出了什么事，一定要叫我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "b351e3e9321e2f85544258e5639273a72fff62875f12ded6a6062e77d8af8e42", "ja": "はーい、なの！", "zh": "好——我知道啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "75133557f59df29494c0938969f36c0c309236de7ceb17ecf7e6c0ce9cb5da09", "ja": "行ってまいります。", "zh": "我出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a2fb2ffd31334606254e933a6dd957a2c98de592e255afbd6922e5832bc957ce", "ja": "（他の事務所のレッスンを試すのは、\nアイドルにとっても貴重な経験ではある）", "zh": "（对偶像来说，尝试其他事务所的课程也是一次难得的经历）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d9427a5444dba052bc7d993ee76da55bde85120985c78b96162cfed908be3d8e", "ja": "（ただ、本当にかなりきついメニューだったから、\n目を離さないようにしておかないとな……）", "zh": "（不过，这次的训练菜单实在太辛苦了，我得时刻留意着她才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
